Fetch, verify, list, and prune supported local model artifacts

Usage: bitnet model [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  fetch   Fetch a supported model artifact into the local cache
  verify  Verify a cached or explicit supported model artifact
  list    List supported model artifacts and cache status
  prune   Remove cached model artifacts
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -c, --config <PATH>      Configuration file path
  -d, --device <DEVICE>    Device/backend label (cpu, cuda/gpu, hip/rocm, oneapi, npu/openvino-npu, nvidia-rtx-5070-ti-cuda/wgpu, metal/mpsgraph, apple-m4-metal, apple-m4-mpsgraph, apple-m4-cpu-neon, auto). Apple M4 labels are distinct proof lanes
      --log-level <LEVEL>  Log level (trace, debug, info, warn, error)
      --threads <N>        Number of CPU threads
      --batch-size <SIZE>  Batch size for processing
  -h, --help               Print help
